    "Tap Ben's newspaper to prompt him to fold it",
    "Engage with Ben through talking, poking, and slapping",
    "Capture funny videos of your phone chats with Ben",
    "Take Ben to his lab and mix test tubes for comical chemical reactions",
    "Share your videos on YouTube or with friends and family"
